00:45:44,780 --> 00:45:47,160
So thank you all for that very much.

594
00:45:47,160 --> 00:45:54,740
The second thing I want to do, Kevin Sullivan, are you here?

595
00:45:54,740 --> 00:45:56,580
Can you come up here real quick?

