Kevin Sullivan is our lead trustee.

598
00:46:03,800 --> 00:46:06,180
Many of you maybe have never even seen his face before.

599
00:46:06,180 --> 00:46:13,540
That's because he likes to be behind the scenes, and which is why he's loving this right now.

