00:46:25,840 --> 00:46:26,120
Okay.

606
00:46:26,380 --> 00:46:31,240
So parking lot, HVAC, on top of many other things that have had to get done.

607
00:46:31,240 --> 00:46:34,720
Kevin has a team of wonderful people.

