00:47:57,260 --> 00:48:08,560
All right, I would love for you to stand and I would love to pray a blessing over you in light of this message on generosity as we exit the building to be the church in our community.

627
00:48:08,560 --> 00:48:12,740
This is from the Scriptures, adapted from the Scriptures.

628
00:48:12,740 --> 00:48:19,580
May God bless you abundantly so that in all things, at all times, you may have all that you need.

629
00:48:19,580 --> 00:48:23,180
May you freely scatter your gifts to the poor.

630
00:48:24,040 --> 00:48:33,340
May God, who supplied seed to the sower and bread for food, also supply and increase your store of seed and enlarge the harvest of your righteousness.

631
00:48:33,340 --> 00:48:38,900
May you be enriched in every way so that you can be generous on every occasion.

